  <p>
    If the three signals still leave you unsure, test it before committing years to it. Volunteer for
    outbound calls or a stall at a college fest, shadow a working rep for a stretch, or take on a short
    commission-only side gig — run it for as long as it genuinely takes to see how you react to a real
    "no," not a hypothetical one. That single test tells you more about fit than another article,
    including this one.
  </p>

